  "description": "<p>Discard existing serialization and use activitystream serialization as illustrated in the spec example.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#minimal-notification-example\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#minimal-notification-example</a></p>\n\n<p>Translate all existing information into its ActivityStream equivalent, where possible.  Create a new ticket for any information that does not map onto ActivityStream vocabulary, or does not seem appropriate to include.</p>\n\n<p>For now, use a local hash URI #agent for the actor, and populate its name with the string name of the user principal.</p>",
